    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Biophobia</strong> is an experimental art game that intertwines dissection and gardening mechanics to explore themes of trauma, death and agency. The body becomes a site of decay and creation. You are invited to confront discomfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702510/extras/5cc45c719a21c9561157ab29fcb05389.poster.avif?t=1753538392\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702510/extras/5cc45c719a21c9561157ab29fcb05389.webm?t=1753538392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702510/extras/5cc45c719a21c9561157ab29fcb05389.mp4?t=1753538392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Gameplay</strong>: Combines a visceral yet delicate dissection with nurturing gardening mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artistic Body Horror</strong>: Experience unsettling yet compassionate depictions of the human form. No gore, but hauntingly beautiful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Creation:</strong> Choose from a variety of seeds. Shape your own floral expression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experimental Aesthetic</strong>: A blend of surreal visuals and symbolic design, challenging traditional game conventions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, Impactful Experience:</strong> Designed to be completed in ~20 minutes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702510/extras/3f6a619f38f25c8072c234159af4f414.poster.avif?t=1753538392\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702510/extras/3f6a619f38f25c8072c234159af4f414.webm?t=1753538392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702510/extras/3f6a619f38f25c8072c234159af4f414.mp4?t=1753538392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cultural references</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the character\u00a0<i>Ophelia</i> from Shakespeare\u2019s Hamlet, Clemente Susini\u2019s wax figure the <i>Anatomical Venus</i>, and Fuyuko Matsui\u2019s painting\u00a0<i>Keeping Up the Pureness</i>, Biophobia reimagines historical depictions of women\u2019s bodies through a modern feminist lens. Without text or dialogue, the game speaks through symbolic interaction, haunting visuals, and atmospheric sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702510/extras/20eeeb874f5e4bd7b8e23d0ab27b2ac4.poster.avif?t=1753538392\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702510/extras/20eeeb874f5e4bd7b8e23d0ab27b2ac4.webm?t=1753538392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702510/extras/20eeeb874f5e4bd7b8e23d0ab27b2ac4.mp4?t=1753538392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Biophobia is a game intended for players who appreciate experimental design, symbolic storytelling, and confronting mature themes in an artistic setting. Some audiences may find the content of this game unsettling. Viewer discretion is advised.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Biophobia</strong> is an experimental art game that intertwines dissection and gardening mechanics to explore themes of trauma, death and agency. The body becomes a site of decay and creation. You are invited to confront discomfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702510/extras/5cc45c719a21c9561157ab29fcb05389.poster.avif?t=1753538392\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702510/extras/5cc45c719a21c9561157ab29fcb05389.webm?t=1753538392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702510/extras/5cc45c719a21c9561157ab29fcb05389.mp4?t=1753538392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Gameplay</strong>: Combines a visceral yet delicate dissection with nurturing gardening mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artistic Body Horror</strong>: Experience unsettling yet compassionate depictions of the human form. No gore, but hauntingly beautiful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Creation:</strong> Choose from a variety of seeds. Shape your own floral expression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experimental Aesthetic</strong>: A blend of surreal visuals and symbolic design, challenging traditional game conventions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, Impactful Experience:</strong> Designed to be completed in ~20 minutes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702510/extras/3f6a619f38f25c8072c234159af4f414.poster.avif?t=1753538392\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702510/extras/3f6a619f38f25c8072c234159af4f414.webm?t=1753538392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702510/extras/3f6a619f38f25c8072c234159af4f414.mp4?t=1753538392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cultural references</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the character\u00a0<i>Ophelia</i> from Shakespeare\u2019s Hamlet, Clemente Susini\u2019s wax figure the <i>Anatomical Venus</i>, and Fuyuko Matsui\u2019s painting\u00a0<i>Keeping Up the Pureness</i>, Biophobia reimagines historical depictions of women\u2019s bodies through a modern feminist lens. Without text or dialogue, the game speaks through symbolic interaction, haunting visuals, and atmospheric sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702510/extras/20eeeb874f5e4bd7b8e23d0ab27b2ac4.poster.avif?t=1753538392\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702510/extras/20eeeb874f5e4bd7b8e23d0ab27b2ac4.webm?t=1753538392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702510/extras/20eeeb874f5e4bd7b8e23d0ab27b2ac4.mp4?t=1753538392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Biophobia is a game intended for players who appreciate experimental design, symbolic storytelling, and confronting mature themes in an artistic setting. Some audiences may find the content of this game unsettling. Viewer discretion is advised.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "A woman is violated by a man. In a final act of rebellion to preserve her humanity, she takes control and opens her stomach. Unable to finish what she started she waits for you, and asks you not to look away.",
